-- **Status:** open
+- **Status:** fixed (the commit that sets this status; message: "orbnet: un-file the
+  outgoing holder's socket at the lane hand-off")
 - **Reported:** 2026-11-10, found while checking G3
 - **Area:** Orb Manager's Go tests (`make check-hub`)
